T1  - Integrating intramuscular fat radiomics with hamstrings-to-quadriceps structure and function ratios to predict future hamstring strain injury.
DO  - 10.1371/journal.pdig.0001144
A1  - Sharma, Akanksha
A1  - Smith, Daniel R
A1  - Slutsky-Ganesh, Alexis B
A1  - Diekfuss, Jed A
A1  - Hogg, Jennifer A
A1  - Foss, Kim D Barber
