T1  - Timing and Dose Matter: Late High-Speed Exposure and Higher High-Intensity Acceleration Volumes Reduce Hamstring Reinjury Risk in Elite Male Football (Soccer).
DO  - 10.2519/jospt.2026.14077
A1  - Pecci, Javier
A1  - Castilla-Lopez, Christian
