T1  - Torque-angle curve of the knee flexors in athletes with a prior history of hamstring strain.
DO  - 10.1016/j.ptsp.2021.11.008
A1  - Mikami, Kentaro
A1  - Samukawa, Mina
A1  - Oba, Kensuke
A1  - Nakamura, Kentaro
