T1  - 2019 Rome Marathon, hamstring injuries in long distance runners: influence of age, gender, weight, height, number of marathons and impact profile.
DO  - 10.23736/S0022-4707.21.12027-4
A1  - Longo, Umile Giuseppe
A1  - Stelitano, Giovanna
A1  - Berton, Alessandra
A1  - Candela, Vincenzo
A1  - Barneschi, Gianfilippo
