T1  - Acute hamstring strain injury in track-and-field athletes: A 3-year observational study at the Penn Relay Carnival.
DO  - 10.1111/sms.12159
A1  - Opar, D A
A1  - Drezner, J
A1  - Shield, A
A1  - Williams, M
A1  - Webner, D
